INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'Jack Keane', 'Colonial England. Under a certain amount of duress... Jack takes on a job, which will not only cause him a great deal of trouble, but also bring to light the answer to a mystery out of his distant past. A lack of money leads Jack to accept a charter to take a British secret agent to mysterious ''Tooth Island''. When Jack''s ship shatters on the mysterious island''s cliffs on arrival and the secret agent quickly becomes a meal for a monster in the jungle, Jack is soon left to cope with the situation on his own.
